issue_context.body:
**Describe the bug:** Modifying colours of `Triangles` do not affect existing triangle particles shown on screen.

The code I used to change triangles colours is by implementing `IHasAccentColour` and set `ColourLight`, `ColourDark` respectively.
```csharp
public class HeaderButton : TriangleButton, IHasAccentColour
{
    private Color4 accentColour;

    public Color4 AccentColour
    {
        get => accentColour;
        set
        {
            accentColour = value;

            BackgroundColour = accentColour;
            Triangles.ColourLight = accentColour.Lighten(0.8f);
            Triangles.ColourDark = accentColour;
        }
    }
}

// button.FadeAccent(colours.Red, 500, Easing.InOutExpo);
```

**Screenshots or videos showing encountered issue:** https://streamable.com/ss12q
